{"version":1,"content":"<p>第九屆中國國際進口博覽會將於明日（5日）在上海國家會展中心開幕。</p><p>國台辦發言人朱鳳蓮今（4日）在例行記者會表示，台灣地區有30多家企業參展，展位面積約4200平方米，涵蓋食品、日化、消費品、醫療、健康、精密製造及現代服務等領域。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T03:44:50.417787+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T03:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T04:38:24.405538+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T03:38:19.329654+00:00","content_hash":"bf1690b1636563ada45daf19113bd2289770f9a4d4f9b8a8e6fb2ab54b80bac4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}